{"title":"Career Roadmap: Interior Designer","role":"Interior Designer","summary":"An Interior Designer plans and designs interior spaces for residential, commercial, hospitality, retail, workplace, healthcare and other environments. The role combines spatial planning, aesthetics, human behaviour, materials, lighting, furniture, technical drawings, building services, budgeting and project execution.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Interior Design"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in spatial planning, design, materials, lighting, furniture, CAD/BIM, visualization, building systems and professional interior design practice"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Interior Designer plans and designs interior spaces for residential, commercial, hospitality, retail, workplace, healthcare and other environments. The role combines spatial planning, aesthetics, human behaviour, materials, lighting, furniture, technical drawings, building services, budgeting and project execution."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Interior Design","Design Fundamentals","Space Planning","Drawing","Materials","Furniture","Lighting","CAD","3D Visualization","Building Systems","Construction Documentation","Sustainability","Project Management","Internship","Interior Designer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Design Intern","Design Assistant","Junior Interior Designer","Interior Designer","Senior Interior Designer","Design Lead","Design Manager / Principal Designer / Creative Director"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof / Portfolio","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals, drawing, visual communication, space unde